Hello all,

the english wikipedia article of lojban contains a lot of links, many of which
are not functional or up-to-date any more, like the lsg2 interface for joining
the mailing lists (as they are on google groups now) or jbobac (which has been
abandoned some time ago) or the lojban livejournal group, which hasn't seen many
posts recently at all and so on and so forth.

I don't really have the time right now, but this can be done bit-by-bit I
suppose. It's just that someone would have to invest a few minutes ;)

